cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "Forecasting Electronic-Resource Usage with Foundation Models"
abstract: >-
  Templates and reference implementation for forecasting the monthly usage of
  academic databases (COUNTER 5, Total Item Requests) with time-series
  foundation models (TimesFM, Chronos-Bolt, TabPFN-TS), compared against
  classical AutoML (PyCaret) and a Seasonal Naive baseline, with a clustering
  and recommendation layer for subscription decisions in a university-library
  consortium.
type: software
